{
  "declaredLength": 2588,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "당신이 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C774002000100002010000000020C528003F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 최애가 너무나도 멋진 사진을 올렸거든요!\n이걸 봐 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020CD5CC560AC000020B108BB34B098B3C40020BA4BC9C40020C0ACC9C4C7440020C62CB838AC70B4E0C6940021000AC774AC780020BD100020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리 씨와 저리더프가\n벤치에서 쉬는 사진이에요! 대박이죠!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B098B9AC0020C528C6400020C800B9ACB354D504AC00000ABCA4CE58C5D0C11C0020C26CB2940020C0ACC9C4C774C5D0C69400210020B300BC15C774C8E00021003F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저도 사진의 벤치에 앉아서\n썬더볼트와 사진을 찍고 싶어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B3C40020C0ACC9C4C7580020BCA4CE58C5D00020C549C544C11C000AC36CB354BCFCD2B8C6400020C0ACC9C4C7440020CC0DACE00020C2F6C5B4C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨, 부탁드려요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002C0020BD80D0C1B4DCB824C694002E00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사진에 나온 벤치를 찾아 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC9C4C5D00020B098C6280020BCA4CE58B97C0020CC3EC5440020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보르보르!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4B974BCF4B97400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "벤치가 찍힌 사진을\n보여 드릴까요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCA4CE58AC000020CC0DD78C0020C0ACC9C4C744000ABCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9B4AE4CC694003F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보여 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "괜찮아요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD1CCC2EC544C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 사진이에요!\n어디에 있는 벤치인지 아시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C0ACC9C4C774C5D0C6940021000AC5B4B514C5D00020C788B2940020BCA4CE58C778C9C00020C544C2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사진에 나온 벤치를 찾아 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC9C4C5D00020B098C6280020BCA4CE58B97C0020CC3EC5440020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "의뢰인이 찾고 있는\n벤치를 발견했다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C758B8B0C778C7740020CC3EACE00020C788B294000ABCA4CE58B97C0020BC1CACACD588B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나란히 놓인 두 개의 플랜터!\n뒤로 보이는 건물과 산까지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B780D7880020B193C7780020B4500020AC1CC7580020D50CB79CD1300021000AB4A4B85C0020BCF4C774B2940020AC74BB3CACFC0020C0B0AE4CC9C0002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리 씨의 사진은\n여기에서 찍은 게 분명해요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B098B9AC0020C528C7580020C0ACC9C4C740000AC5ECAE30C5D0C11C0020CC0DC7400020AC8C0020BD84BA85D574C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바로 앉아 봐야지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B85C0020C549C5440020BD10C57CC9C0002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리 씨가 앉은 벤치에 앉다니!\n제가 카나리 씨가 된 기분이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B098B9AC0020C528AC000020C549C7400020BCA4CE58C5D00020C549B2E4B2C80021000AC81CAC000020CE74B098B9AC0020C528AC000020B41C0020AE30BD84C774C5D0C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨,\n카나리 씨의 사진과 똑같은 느낌으로<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n사진을 찍어 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002C000ACE74B098B9AC0020C528C7580020C0ACC9C4ACFC0020B611AC19C7400020B290B08CC73CB85C00100001BE00000AC0ACC9C4C7440020CC0DC5B40020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 사진에 나온 앵글을\n완벽하게 재현해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C0ACC9C4C5D00020B098C6280020C575AE00C744000AC644BCBDD558AC8C0020C7ACD604D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사진을 확인하고 싶으시면\n언제든지 말씀해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC9C4C7440020D655C778D558ACE00020C2F6C73CC2DCBA74000AC5B8C81CB4E0C9C00020B9D0C500D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리 씨의 사진을\n보여 드릴까요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B098B9AC0020C528C7580020C0ACC9C4C744000ABCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9B4AE4CC694003F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보여 주세요<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC138C69400100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "괜찮아요<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD1CCC2EC544C69400100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리 씨의 사진과 똑같은 느낌으로\n살짝 먼 곳에서 촬영해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B098B9AC0020C528C7580020C0ACC9C4ACFC0020B611AC19C7400020B290B08CC73CB85C000AC0B4C9DD0020BA3C0020ACF3C5D0C11C0020CD2CC601D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맞아요!\n그 근처예요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DEC544C6940021000AADF80020ADFCCC98C608C694002E002E002E00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아닌가...?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n살짝 앵글이 다른 것 같네요...\n저는 완벽하게 재현하고 싶어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2CCAC00002E002E002E003F00100001BE01000AC0B4C9DD0020C575AE00C7740020B2E4B9780020AC830020AC19B124C694002E002E002E000AC800B2940020C644BCBDD558AC8C0020C7ACD604D558ACE00020C2F6C5B4C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바로 거기예요!\n그 자리에서 촬영해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B85C0020AC70AE30C608C6940021000AADF80020C790B9ACC5D0C11C0020CD2CC601D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 그럼!\n사진을 확인해 볼게요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020ADF8B7FC0021000AC0ACC9C4C7440020D655C778D5740020BCFCAC8CC694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와우! 완벽하게 재현해 주셨네요!\n제가 카나리 씨가 된 기분이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C640C6B000210020C644BCBDD558AC8C0020C7ACD604D5740020C8FCC168B124C6940021000AC81CAC000020CE74B098B9AC0020C528AC000020B41C0020AE30BD84C774C5D0C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "찍어 주신 사진을\nSNS에 업로드하면... 됐다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC0DC5B40020C8FCC2E00020C0ACC9C4C744000A0053004E0053C5D00020C5C5B85CB4DCD558BA74002E002E002E0020B410B2E4002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데, 카나리 씨를 찍어 준 사람은\n소문의 프로듀서인 걸까요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B370002C0020CE74B098B9AC0020C528B97C0020CC0DC5B40020C9000020C0ACB78CC740000AC18CBB38C7580020D504B85CB4C0C11CC7780020AC78AE4CC694003F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리빵도 나쁘진 않지만, 아크릴 스탠드나\n아크릴 키링도 있으면 좋을 텐데 말이죠...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B098B9ACBE75B3C40020B098C058C9C40020C54AC9C0B9CC002C0020C544D06CB9B40020C2A4D0E0B4DCB098000AC544D06CB9B40020D0A4B9C1B3C40020C788C73CBA740020C88BC7440020D150B3700020B9D0C774C8E0002E002E002E00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼!\n다른 카나리 씨 사진도 따라 해 봐야겠어요!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그러려고 미르에 온 거니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC0021000AB2E4B9780020CE74B098B9AC0020C5280020C0ACC9C4B3C40020B530B77C0020D5740020BD10C57CACA0C5B4C694002100100001BE00000AADF8B7ECB824ACE00020BBF8B974C5D00020C6280020AC70B2C8AE4CC694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨, 수고 많으셨어요!\n괜찮으시다면 벤치에서 좀 쉬다 가세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002C0020C218ACE00020B9CEC73CC168C5B4C6940021000AAD1CCC2EC73CC2DCB2E4BA740020BCA4CE58C5D0C11C0020C8800020C26CB2E40020AC00C138C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 먼저 가 볼게요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020BA3CC8000020AC000020BCFCAC8CC694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음에는 카나리 씨가 퀴즈 대회를 열었던\n장소를 찾아서 사진을 찍어야겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74CC5D0B2940020CE74B098B9AC0020C528AC000020D034C9880020B300D68CB97C0020C5F4C5C8B358000AC7A5C18CB97C0020CC3EC544C11C0020C0ACC9C4C7440020CC0DC5B4C57CACA0C5B4C694002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보르보르!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
